abstract: 'An AI-assisted Lean 4 companion across Models for dagger (infinity,1)-categories II. The English
  catalogue has 49 grouped results: the original Theorems A, B and C and 46 substantial supporting propositions
  or construction theorems, linked to 166 distinct declaration roots. The current selected-root local
  audit and the three main aliases have standard transitive axioms only. A retains its universe parameter;
  full B and the original four-link C have value universe zero. Hypotheses, actual models, adjoints and
  directions are retained. The prose is identified as AI-generated. Current checks use verified existing
  imports; a cold full build, new hosted Linux CI or Comparator pass, and independent human correspondence
  review are not claimed. Part I remains a separate pinned dependency.'
